<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese money supply rises 8.3 pct Sept.</title>
<headline>Portuguese money supply rises 8.3 pct Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese money supply, as measured by &quot;aggregate L-&quot;, roughly equivalent to M3, rose 8.3 percent year-on-year in September, compared with 8.5 percent in August, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
